{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115130","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115130/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115130/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115130/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115130","id":3830182486,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6-CD_W","number":115130,"title":"Fix crash in LineEdit when theme font is missing","user":{"login":"LanzaSchneider","id":24624901,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NjI0OTAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24624901?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider","html_url":"https://github.com/LanzaSchneider","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":13,"created_at":"2026-01-19T15:21:52Z","updated_at":"2026-01-22T13:30:05Z","closed_at":"2026-01-22T13:29:52Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115130","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115130","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115130.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115130.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## Issue description\r\nGodot crashes when opening a scene that contains a LineEdit control with a missing/deleted font resource from its theme.\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n1. Create a scene with a LineEdit control\r\n2. Assign a custom font resource to the LineEdit's theme\r\n3. Save the scene\r\n4. Delete the font resource file from the filesystem\r\n5. Restart the editor and attempt to open the scene again\r\n6. **Result**: Editor crashes\r\n\r\n### Crash details\r\nThe crash occurs in `LineEdit::get_minimum_size()` when dereferencing a null font pointer:\r\n\r\n```\r\n[0] LineEdit::get_minimum_size (scene/gui/line_edit.cpp:2451)\r\n...\r\n[23] EditorNode::set_edited_scene_root (editor/editor_node.cpp:4464)\r\n[24] EditorNode::set_edited_scene (editor/editor_node.cpp:4443)\r\n[25] EditorNode::load_scene (editor/editor_node.cpp:4803)\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Root cause\r\nIn `LineEdit::get_minimum_size()`, the code directly accesses the font from theme cache without null validation:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nfloat em_space_size = font->get_char_size('W', font_size).x; // Crash if font is null\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhen a font resource is missing, `theme_cache.font` is null, causing a null pointer dereference.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\nAdd a defensive null check at the beginning of the function. If the font is missing, return a safe default minimum size:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nif (font.is_null()) {\r\n    return Size2(); // Return zero size if font is missing\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis follows the same defensive pattern used in other UI controls and prevents the crash while allowing the editor to gracefully handle missing resources.\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n- Reproduced the original crash by deleting a dependent font resource\r\n- Applied the fix and verified the editor no longer crashes when opening the scene","closed_by":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115130/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115130/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}